<title>GREECE: TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, JAN 30.</title>
<headline>TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, JAN 30.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Greece's fixing rates</p>
<p>for leading currencies on Thursday were as follows.</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> Currency:	Jan 30	Jan 29	Dec 31 96    NET</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>- USD =	  257.090     259.630     247.020    4.08 %</p>
<p>- ECU =	  303.990     304.400     306.830   -0.93 %</p>
<p>- DEM =	  156.860     157.050     158.970   -1.33 %</p>
<p>- FRF =	   46.484	46.544	47.182   -1.48 %</p>
<p>- GBP =	  417.060     418.420     419.180   -0.51 %</p>
<p>- NLG =	  139.740     139.815     141.685   -1.37 %</p>
<p>- ITL (100) =   16.007	15.961	16.185   -1.10 %</p>
<p>- JPY (100) =  211.300     211.900     212.430   -0.53 %</p>
<p>- ESP =	    1.858	 1.855	 1.888   -1.59 %</p>
<p>- PTE =	    1.567	 1.565	 1.581   -0.89 %</p>
<p>- CHF =	  180.250     181.655     183.135   -1.58 %</p>
<p>Note: The percentage net change is calculated as the percentage</p>
<p>difference between the most recent fixing rate and the January</p>
<p>02, 1997 rate.</p>
<p>--Dimitris Kontogiannis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
